## 📈 Dashboard Development

A good Excel dashboard should help users understand the most important information quickly.

Typical dashboard components include:

* Revenue
* Profit
* Sales Growth
* Customer Count
* Average Order Value
* Regional Performance
* Product Performance
* Monthly Trends
* KPI Variance

The goal is not to add more charts.

The goal is to make business decisions easier.
---

# 🧠 What Level of Excel Should a Data Analyst Master?

A Data Analyst should ideally reach at least an Intermediate-to-Advanced Excel level.

You should be comfortable performing analysis without depending heavily on manual steps.

A strong Excel analyst should be able to:

✅ Clean raw datasets
✅ Build complex formulas
✅ Use XLOOKUP and INDEX-MATCH
✅ Create PivotTables
✅ Use Power Query
✅ Build interactive dashboards
✅ Analyze business KPIs
✅ Troubleshoot formula errors
✅ Automate repetitive reporting
✅ Explain insights to stakeholders
